        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  Is he really commanding his troops like that? How can he give such precise orders just by barking out chess moves?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Is he really commanding his troops like that? How can he give such precise orders just by barking out chess moves?"
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  Those same disorderly thugs have been turned into an army under his command...!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Those same disorderly thugs have been turned into an army under his command...!"
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  At this rate, he's going to keep exploiting the advantage he gets through his leadership...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "At this rate, he's going to keep exploiting the advantage he gets through his leadership..."
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_130_doberm_ex\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   On the other hand, if we manage to suppress him, they'll fall into disarray!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "On the other hand, if we manage to suppress him, they'll fall into disarray!"
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   Don't give them even the slightest opening!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "Don't give them even the slightest opening!"
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   Damn it, we're running out of time!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "Damn it, we're running out of time!"
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "id": 83,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  We can't allow ourselves to be stalled any longer!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "We can't allow ourselves to be stalled any longer!"
    },
